## SQL over a saved scan

`references/sql.md` beside this file holds the tables a saved scan has, the
functions duscope adds, and {{sql_count}} statements an agent can start from, each
run on duscope's fixture tree by its tests. Run one with
`duscope query PATH --sql "…" --json`; `duscope schema` lists the tables.
